{"format_version":2,"id":"18c135f97286111a9a2f56668e6346478f408d81fae92bf9","commits":["7eef1908250e53cef471a850ea03553a82c1f50b"],"user_facing":true,"description":"**Health no longer claims inode cleanup it could not persist.** On read-only workspaces the inode check now reports that stale entries were found but not persisted, instead of 'cleaned'.","type":"fix"}
